"document:0:581:0":{"key":"document:0:581:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"0","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"【禁咒演化综述】\n阶段一：<style=\"highlight\">血肉禁锢（原型）</style>\n缺陷：仅限直系血亲使用，且施术者需承担巨大反噬风险。\n评价：原始、低效，受限于血缘的枷锁。\n\n阶段二：<style=\"highlight\">黑暗转移（进阶）</style>\n突破：移除了血亲限制。\n缺陷：仍需受体“自愿”承担代价。\n\n阶段三：<style=\"highlight\">终极·黑暗掠夺</style>\n……第三阶段的研究已接近尾声。不同于前两阶段的“血亲禁锢”与“黑暗转移”，真正的伟大，在于不经允许的“剥夺”。\n无需契约，无需知情。只要满足特定条件，即可强制将自身的代价与诅咒转移给第三方，并反向掠夺其权能。\n\n第一次实验（已完成）\n实验对象：<style=\"highlight\">样本 X（注：指埃摩森）</style>\n实验结果：<style=\"highlight\">成功。</style>\n过程记录：“虽然样本 X 进行了激烈的魔力抵抗，但‘掠夺’依然生效。他的魔力源被强行剥离，生命力在一瞬间枯竭。死因被伪造成魔法反噬，无人怀疑。”\n\n最终实验计划：\n实验对象：<style=\"highlight\">M</style>\n拥有这个时代最完美的超凡特质。无论是魔力回路的纯净度，还是灵魂的韧性，都是最佳供体。缺点在于其魔力过于庞大，且精神防御极高。\n\n解决方案：\n构建一个超高阶的复合增幅法阵，配合诱饵将其引入阵眼，先压制其魔力活性，再进行掠夺。\n\n当前状态：<style=\"highlight\">法阵绘制完成80%（核心符文尚未闭环）</style>\n状态：暂不可用","textdes_id":"581","document_page_count":"2","document_title_cn":"禁术研究手稿","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:1:1711062301:1":{"key":"say:1:1711062301:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711062301","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"读到最后，你的脊背泛起一阵寒意，下意识地看向了密室正中...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1711062302:1":{"key":"say:2:1711062302:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711062302","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那个占据了大半个房间的巨大暗红色法阵，原来有一个最终实...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:旁白":{"key":"speaker:旁白","source":"旁白"}},"stats":{"source_node_count":4,"graph_node_count":4,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":3,"speaker_entry_count":1,"cast_state_line_count":2,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}}